<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes persist in Bangui among government forces, former Séléka rebels and Anti-balaka militias, with Russian Wagner forces and Africa Corps shielding President Touadéra. A planned large-scale militant attack was foiled, showing rebel capacity to organize major operations. Humanitarian assistance is now at risk as aid deliveries face increasing insecurity. The conflict remains entrenched and destabilising across the country. There were 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOV21leHdWY0ZJaTNsclFDN3BGUGlUaThaRFVIcVpqcWdMY0hYZ25rVmU4a05JVUFyblRNbUswTmZSbVhfcG0wYXhwLUd6UmJEUHVZc3BJblR6VHZpVGdKeUhNU0tabTRUR2h0VVBUS05PbmZMS1hNRTFPeV9wTl9XWHhvUWVHcVJUUjRkaVFac25xdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNYU5NQkwzVEI5V1VEREs4X2VOblhOVW5vREI4ZF9wYWNaWmJwSm5PUXFXNktIUFduMzg2TDNHVkc5M3lxb2FCb2h1ei1VU1pZUGFIWGNVVWw5RmlxZkVWOUV4ZTZMQXFpbjNSN2xpdWp6OHFWOVlvNUpGNU9nLWlzX0FHNzFqZ3ZQTGNyLWF4ejdEell6RU55QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Leicester Mercury&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQc3I1TlFXNlVFcnB3QVdYYTRtd3FkUTk4U3V1QWQ4eUl5M1ZuRVFXaXAzQWt5SXk1MjBWTU1XaEtuNE1oaW14LW8zS2NQSUlKU1d4cnRab3poVUhHbWRtSHY0bEhBWWF4VlQ3dVE5MlFIb3JFRnlLNUt1QVFsOWFjc24wX2FyZy11VEZhTHlaLWRBeXhmOGtScDlUQ21Jc3JmMTY1UW1vd3RCd1dzT2hIOV9QWDZpVy1HV291cFZFVXc0dVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPaGhqRFF2TVd0aUU4N1ExNzhTYUt5eWJMZVZ0S3FzNXgtcjl2YWZJRzJjeUI4bXZMdXcyU2tSVFpFZjF